			<Text>觀察者</Text>
		</Replace>
		<Replace Tag="LOC_CIVILIZATION_ZOM_OBSERVER_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hant_HK">
			<Text>一個從不定居的文明。它以觀戰者之眼代替創立者開局，能看到每個格子和每個單位。由 Zatygold's Spectator 新增。</Text>
		</Replace>
		<Replace Tag="LOC_TRAIT_ZOM_OBSERVER_NAME" Language="zh_Hant_HK">
			<Text>觀戰者</Text>
		</Replace>
		<Replace Tag="LOC_TRAIT_ZOM_OBSERVER_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hant_HK">
			<Text>以觀戰者之眼代替創立者開局。無加成。</Text>
		</Replace>
